OL,3,GNEWSAFamily who died in e-bike fire got
OL,4,Atrapped upstairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people who died in a fire linked
OL,7,Fto an e-bike were trapped upstairs, an
OL,8,Finquest has heard.
OL,10,FGemma Germeney and children Lilly,
OL,11,Feight, and Oliver, four, all lost their
OL,12,Flives after the fire on Sackville Close
OL,13,Fin Cambridge in June 2023. The
OL,14,Fchildren's father Scott Peden survived.
OL,16,FAn inquest at Huntingdon Coroner's
OL,17,FCourt heard 999 calls stated they
OL,18,F"could hear explosions and people
OL,19,Fscreaming".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
